# Guests of the Empire (ToAU 17) with its RoV era module (mission_adjustments.lua; RESTRICT_CONTENT 1, ENABLE_ROV 0):
# Status 2, dressed and bare-handed: the Imperial Whitegate 3078, finished: completed, the must-zone var and the Timer
# set to JST midnight.
module modules/era/lua/missions/mission_adjustments.lua
lists AhtUrhganWhitegate/Naja_Salaheem/onTrigger AhtUrhganWhitegate/Imperial_Whitegate/onTrigger AhtUrhganWhitegate/onEventUpdate/3076 AhtUrhganWhitegate/onEventFinish/3076 AhtUrhganWhitegate/onEventFinish/3078
char zone=AhtUrhganWhitegate pos=40,-6,-30 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=1
mission Asa BurgeoningDread current
mission Acp ACrystallineProphecyFin current
mission Rov ARhapsodyForTheAges current
mission Soa Abomination current
mission Toau GuestsOfTheEmpire current
item Hauberk
item BronzeMittens
item BronzeSubligar
item BronzeLeggings
setting RESTRICT_CONTENT 1
setting ENABLE_ROV 0
login
tick 1000
tick 1000
tick 1000
missionstatus Toau 2
equip Hauberk Body
equip BronzeMittens Hands
equip BronzeSubligar Legs
